boxes.text:
(array of dictionaries or dictionary or dictionaries)  individual parts should have 2-3 keys, "name", "file", "content", or "contenttype". eg:
[		
{"name":"file-0", "file": "/full/path/to/filename.jpg"}, 
{"name": "file-1", "file": "/full/path/to/filename2.jpg"}, 
{"name": "filecount", "content": "2" } 
]   
OR:
{
   "part1" : {"name":"myfirstfile", "file": "/full/path/to/filename.jpg"}, 
   "part2" : {"name": "anotherfile", "file": "/full/path/to/filename2.jpg"}, 
   "part3" : {"name": "filecount", "content": "2" } 
}
